        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 132304,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I parametri di query sono una parte importante della creazione di API e ci permettono di creare route più dinamiche e versatili. Iniziamo!</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 132305,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I parametri di query vengono aggiunti nell'URL dopo un <code>?</code>. Non modificano l'endpoint, ma forniscono informazioni aggiuntive al server.</p><p>Qui, <code>name</code> è la chiave e <code>Maria</code> è il valore passato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"localhost:3000/greet?name=Maria\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>?</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I parametri di query vengono aggiunti nell'URL dopo un <code>?</code>. Non modificano l'endpoint, ma forniscono informazioni aggiuntive al server.</p><p>Invia <code>Maria</code> come valore del parametro di query chiamato <code>name</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"localhost:3000/greet?name=Maria\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greet\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>?</code>, seguito da <code>name</code> e infine <code>Maria</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 132306,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo accedere al valore dei parametri di query usando <code>req.query.key</code>. Creiamo un endpoint che restituisca il valore di un parametro di query.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"60\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Maria!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>req</code>, seguito da <code>query</code> e infine <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puoi accedere ai valori dei parametri di query con <code>req.query.key</code>. Crea un endpoint che restituisca il valore di un parametro.</p><p>Per una richiesta a <code>/greet?name=Maria</code>, leggi il valore di query usato nel saluto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"res\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"params\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greet\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Maria!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>req</code>, seguito da <code>query</code> e infine <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 132307,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I parametri di query sono facoltativi per natura. Se non forniamo un parametro di query, il suo valore sarà undefined.</p><p>Un caso d'uso comune consiste nel fornire valori predefiniti con <code>||</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name || \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Guest\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>||</code>, seguito da <code>\"Guest\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I parametri di query sono facoltativi. Se non fornisci un parametro di query, il suo valore sarà undefined.</p><p>Un caso d'uso comune consiste nel fornire valori predefiniti con <code>||</code>.</p><p>Usa <code>Guest</code> quando manca <code>name</code>. Mantieni un nome fornito, ad esempio <code>Maria</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name || \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Maria&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Guest!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>||</code>, seguito da <code>\"Guest\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy",
            "id": 132470,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Potresti voler distinguere tra <code>undefined</code>, <code>null</code> o valori vuoti. L'operatore <code>??</code> (operatore di coalescenza nullish) è utile in questo caso.</p><p>A differenza di <code>||</code>, che considera allo stesso modo <code>null</code>, <code>undefined</code> e i valori falsy (come <code>0</code> o <code>\"\"</code>), <code>??</code> considera solo <code>null</code> e <code>undefined</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name ?? \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Guest\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>??</code>, seguito da <code>\"Guest\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Potresti voler distinguere tra <code>undefined</code>, <code>null</code> o valori vuoti. L'operatore <code>??</code> (operatore di coalescenza nullish) è utile in questo caso.</p><p>A differenza di <code>||</code>, che considera allo stesso modo <code>null</code>, <code>undefined</code> e i valori falsy (come <code>0</code> o <code>\"\"</code>), <code>??</code> considera solo <code>null</code> e <code>undefined</code>.</p><p>Usa <code>Guest</code> quando manca <code>name</code>, ma mantieni una stringa vuota se viene fornita.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name ?? \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"||\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Maria&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Guest!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>??</code>, seguito da <code>\"Guest\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132471,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qui, <code>??</code> garantisce che <code>\"\"</code> o <code>0</code> non attivino il valore predefinito.</p><p>Potresti finire per dire <code>\"Hello, \"</code> quando ricevi una stringa vuota per il parametro di query name.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name ?? \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Hello, \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, \" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>??</code>, seguito da <code>\"Guest\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qui, <code>??</code> garantisce che <code>\"\"</code> o <code>0</code> non attivino il valore predefinito.</p><p>Potresti finire per dire <code>\"Hello, \"</code> quando ricevi una stringa vuota per il parametro di query name.</p><p>Mantieni il nome vuoto, quindi invia il saluto tramite una variabile di risposta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"get\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/greet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"req\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"query\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"?\" /><text value=\"?\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greeting\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Hello, ${name}`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"send\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"greeting\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"129\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req.params.name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"||\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"message\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, \" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>req.query.name</code>, seguito da <code>??</code>, <code>\"Guest\"</code>, <code>greeting</code> e infine <code>greeting</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy",
            "id": 132313,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo avere più parametri di query. Li combiniamo nell'URL con <code>&amp;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"localhost:3000/info?name=Maria&amp;age=62\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>?</code>, seguito da <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puoi avere più parametri di query. Combinali nell'URL con <code>&amp;</code>.</p><p>Invia <code>Maria</code> come <code>name</code> e <code>62</code> come <code>age</code>, in quest'ordine.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"localhost:3000/info?name=Maria&amp;age=62\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>?</code>, seguito da <code>name</code>, <code>&amp;</code> e infine <code>age</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 132308,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se abbiamo più parametri di query, possiamo accedervi singolarmente tramite il loro nome.</p><p>Vediamo cosa restituiremo nel caso in cui il parametro di query <code>name</code> venga passato come <code>\"Lin\"</code>, ma <code>age</code> non venga passato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/info&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name || \" /><text value=\"'Unknown'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = req.query.age || \" /><text value=\"'Unknown'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Name: \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\", Age: \" /><text value=\"${age}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"98\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Name: Lin, Age: Unknown\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>name</code>, seguito da <code>age</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se abbiamo più parametri di query, possiamo accedervi singolarmente tramite il loro nome.</p><p>Vediamo cosa restituiremo nel caso in cui il parametro di query <code>name</code> venga passato come <code>\"Lin\"</code>, ma <code>age</code> non venga passato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/info&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = req.query.name || \" /><text value=\"'Unknown'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = req.query.age || \" /><text value=\"'Unknown'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.send(\" /><text value=\"`Name: \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\", Age: \" /><text value=\"${age}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/info&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'Unknown'\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"app\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Name: Lin, Age: Unknown\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>name</code>, seguito da <code>age</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 132311,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se il nostro endpoint richiede determinati parametri di query, possiamo verificare che siano stati forniti e restituire un errore in caso contrario.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/search&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" query = req.query.query;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" limit = \" /><text value=\"parseInt\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(req.query.limit);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!query) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing query parameter.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" limit = limit || \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here's the result of your search!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"96\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Here's the result of your search!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>req</code>, seguito da <code>query</code> e poi <code>req</code>, <code>query</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se il tuo endpoint richiede determinati parametri di query, puoi verificare che siano presenti e restituire un errore in caso contrario.</p><p>Leggi dalla richiesta in arrivo i parametri di query chiamati <code>query</code> e <code>limit</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/search&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" query = req.query.query;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" limit = \" /><text value=\"parseInt\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(req.query.limit);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (!query) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing query parameter.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" limit = limit || \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Here's the result of your search!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"res\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"params\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"method\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Here's the result of your search!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>req</code>, seguito da <code>query</code>, <code>req</code> e infine <code>query</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 132310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa restituisce <code>req.query</code> in Express?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un oggetto con i parametri della query come coppie chiave-valore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una stringa che rappresenta la stringa di query</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un oggetto con i parametri della query come coppie chiave-valore.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una richiesta arriva a <code>/search?topic=node</code>. Quale forma ha il valore esposto da Express tramite <code>req.query</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un oggetto con i parametri della query come coppie chiave-valore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una stringa che rappresenta la stringa di query</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Trasforma ogni proprietà in un elemento di un array.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un oggetto con i parametri della query come coppie chiave-valore.</p></body></html>"
