            "id": 132652,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come accedi ai parametri di query in un gestore di route?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Utilizzando <code>req.query</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Usando <code>req.params</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Utilizzando <code>req.query</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una richiesta arriva a <code>/products?sort=price</code>. Quale espressione legge <code>price</code> nel gestore della route?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>req.query.sort</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.params.sort</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.query.price</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>req.query.sort</code>.</p></body></html>"
