            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come recuperi un parametro di query chiamato <code>category</code> all'interno dell'endpoint <code>/items</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/items&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;What category?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>req.query.category</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.params.category</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>req.query.category</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una richiesta raggiunge l'endpoint mostrato come <code>/items?category=books</code>. Quale espressione recupera <code>books</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/items&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;What category?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>req.query.category</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.params.category</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>req.query.items</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>req.query.category</code>.</p></body></html>"
