            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Configura correttamente l'URL.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"bash\" name=\"script.sh\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"localhost:\" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"/info?name=Maria&amp;age=\" /><text value=\"62\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"&amp;city=Paris\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"#\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>?</code>, seguito da <code>&amp;</code> e infine <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>"
